sed?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Our garments are crafted from<strong>high-quality fabrics<\/strong>such as<strong>wool, linen, cotton, viscose<\/strong>, and more. Our footwear is made from<strong>genuine leather and suede<\/strong>. While we focus on using natural fibers, some items may contain<strong>allergy-free synthetic blends<\/strong>to enhance comfort, durability, and fit.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_JaxRHH":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How much does shipping cost?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>We are Offering Free Shipping.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_WcVEVb":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How long does shipping take?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Orders are processed within 1-2 Days and Transit time is 2-3 Days. <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_NPQD3h":{"type":"collapsible_row","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"How can I be sure my package will arrive safely and on time?","icon":"check_mark","row_content":"<p>We work with trusted local couriers to ensure your order arrives safely and on time. Every shipment includes a <strong>track & trace code<\/strong>, so you can follow your package every step of the way — from our warehouse to your doorstep. And if you ever experience a delay or need assistance, our friendly customer support team is here for you.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_qEHPcY":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is your return & refund policy?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>We have a 30-day return policy, which means you have 30 days after receiving your item to request a return.<br\/><br\/>To be eligible for a return, your item must be in the same condition that you received it, unworn or unused, with tags, and in its original packaging. You’ll also need the receipt or proof of purchase.<br\/><br\/>To start a return, you can contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@ventayo.eu\">info@ventayo.eu<\/a>. Please note that returns will need to be sent to the following address that will be provided<br\/><br\/>If your return is accepted, we’ll send you a return shipping label, as well as instructions on how and where to send your package. Items sent back to us without first requesting a return will not be accepted.<br\/><br\/>You can always contact us for any return question at <a href=\"mailto:info@ventayo.eu\">info@ventayo.eu<\/a>.<br\/><\/p><p><br\/><br\/><br\/><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_bAtk8H":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What If I receive wrong or Damaged Item?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>You got 30-day money back guarantee Please reach out to us using our Live chat button or sending us an e-mail. <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_WLyJjD":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What I am having Delay in receiving my order?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Please reach out to us using our Live chat button or sending us an e-mail.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_9tXALB":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I cancel my order after placing it?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes, you can cancel order if you haven't received the tracking number. But once Order is shipped, Unfortunately it Can't be cancelled. <\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_KDjLqc","collapsible_row_4WwWaD","collapsible_row_JaxRHH","collapsible_row_WcVEVb","collapsible_row_NPQD3h","collapsible_row_qEHPcY","collapsible_row_bAtk8H","collapsible_row_WLyJjD","collapsible_row_9tXALB"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible_content.presets.name","settings":{"caption":"","heading":"<strong>FAQ'S<\/strong>","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"scheme-ad51283d-6044-441e-b8ec-b4441c2da21b","open_first_collapsible_row":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_first","heading_size_row":"h3","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":12}},"contact_form_xMqFfw":{"type":"contact-form","name":"t:sections.contact-form.presets.n